          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="d-flex ms-lg-3 gap-2">
          <a href="contact.html#portal-access" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-login">School Login</a>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-get-started">Get Started</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-section d-flex align-items-center bg-slate py-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center flex-column-reverse flex-lg-row">
        <div class="col-lg-6 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
          <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3 text-navy">Modern Cloud Intelligence for Progressive Schools</h1>
          <p class="lead text-secondary mb-4">Transform your school management with lightning-fast, secure, and intuitive cloud technology. Built for educators, trusted by leaders.</p>
          <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg shadow-sm">Book a Demo</a>
            <a href="features.html" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg">Explore Features</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 text-center">
          <div class="hero-img-frame mx-auto shadow-lg rounded-4 overflow-hidden">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513258496099-48168024aec0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Digital Classroom" class="img-fluid">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust / Stats Bar -->
  <section class="trust-bar py-3 bg-white border-bottom">
    <div class="container d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-4">
      <div class="trust-item"><span class="fw-bold text-navy">Cloud-based school records</span></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><span class="fw-bold text-navy">Role-based portals</span></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><span class="fw-bold text-navy">Academic and fee workflows</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Features Grid -->
  <section id="features" class="features-section py-5 bg-slate">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">Why Choose ScholarBase?</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary">Powerful modules designed for modern academic excellence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="feature-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/fluency/48/000000/graph-report.png" alt="Result Processing" class="mb-3">
            <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-2">Real-Time Result Processing</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary">Automated grading and instant report cards for seamless academic tracking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="feature-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/fluency/48/000000/money-bag.png" alt="Fee Management" class="mb-3">
            <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-2">Automated Fee Management</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary">Transparent dashboards for fee tracking, invoicing, and digital receipts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="feature-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/fluency/48/000000/cloud.png" alt="Cloud Security" class="mb-3">
            <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-2">Secure Cloud Architecture</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary">Bank-grade security and robust cloud infrastructure for peace of mind.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="feature-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/fluency/48/000000/conference-call.png" alt="Role-Based Portals" class="mb-3">
            <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-2">Role-Based Portals</h5>
            <p class="text-secondary">Dedicated portals for admins, teachers, and parents—clarity for every stakeholder.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="audience-section py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container py-lg-4">
      <div class="row align-items-end g-3 mb-4 mb-lg-5">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <p class="eyebrow">Made for the people behind every school day</p>
          <h2 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-0">One school community.<br>Clearer ways to work.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Give each member of your school community the information and tools that make their part of the day easier to manage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4 audience-list">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="audience-item h-100">
            <span class="audience-index">01 / SCHOOL LEADERS</span>
            <h3>See the whole picture.</h3>
            <p>Bring student records, fee activity, and academic progress into one place for more informed school operations.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="audience-item h-100">
            <span class="audience-index">02 / TEACHERS</span>
            <h3>Spend less time compiling.</h3>
            <p>Organize class assessments and term results in a consistent workflow, with less dependence on scattered records.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <article class="audience-item h-100">
            <span class="audience-index">03 / FAMILIES</span>
            <h3>Stay connected to progress.</h3>
            <p>Give parents a dedicated place to follow relevant school updates and student information shared with them.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="audience-action mt-4 mt-lg-5">
        <span>Explore the workflows that bring it together.</span>
        <a href="features.html" class="link-arrow">Explore ScholarBase features <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About G3Tech Section -->
  <section id="about" class="about-section py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
          <h2 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-3">About G3Tech</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary mb-3">G3Tech is an elite IT group of passionate software engineers, architects, and innovators. We build scalable, secure, and lightning-fast solutions for the education sector, blending local insight with world-class engineering.</p>
          <ul class="list-unstyled text-secondary mb-0">
            <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Clean, modern JavaScript architectures</li>
            <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Robust cloud backends</li>
            <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Deep educational insight</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 text-center">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="G3Tech Team" class="img-fluid rounded-4 shadow-lg about-img">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing Section -->
  <section id="pricing" class="pricing-section py-5 bg-slate">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">Transparent Pricing</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary">Flexible plans for every school size. No hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="pricing-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">Starter</h5>
            <div class="display-6 fw-bold text-emerald mb-2">₦250</div>
            <div class="mb-2 text-secondary">per student / term</div>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Core modules</li>
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Email support</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-outline-primary w-100">Get Started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="pricing-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm position-relative border-primary border-2">
            <span class="badge bg-primary position-absolute top-0 start-50 translate-middle-x mt-2">Most Popular</span>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">Standard</h5>
            <div class="display-6 fw-bold text-emerald mb-2">₦400</div>
            <div class="mb-2 text-secondary">per student / term</div>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> All Starter features</li>
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> SMS notifications</li>
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Priority support</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary w-100">Start a Conversation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="pricing-card card h-100 text-center p-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">Enterprise</h5>
            <div class="display-6 fw-bold text-emerald mb-2">Custom</div>
            <div class="mb-2 text-secondary">Flexible billing</div>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> All Standard features</li>
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Dedicated onboarding</li>
              <li><span class="me-2 text-primary">&#10003;</span> Custom integrations</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-outline-primary w-100">Contact Sales</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA Banner -->
  <section class="cta-banner py-5 bg-royal text-white text-center">
